WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.319 --> 00:00:01.960
(upbeat music)

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:05.000
- How do you know when you've made it?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.520
Well, here's one of our guests

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.490
describing the moment
they thought they knew.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.170
- The moment I knew I made it was when

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.840
my mom was in town from Chicago.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.867
She was visiting, I was going
through this audition process

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:23.867
for a show called "New Girl"
and about 15 auditions in,

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:29.070
I book it and I'm driving home.

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:33.090
And then my mom just called
me and we're on the phone,

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:37.210
having a conversation, and
she's elated and I'm elated.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:40.590
And I don't know, it was just
one of those surreal moments,

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:43.640
like I couldn't believe I
was having the conversation

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:47.070
with my mother that finally,
I had done the thing

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:48.410
that I had set out to do

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:53.297
- Well, that was heartwarming
and adorable, I love it.

00:00:53.297 --> 00:00:55.964
(upbeat music)

